    <h2 id="others">Who else is involved</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Discord</strong> stores your account, your messages and your posts. See <a href="https://discord.com/privacy">Discord's privacy policy</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> delivers frostdev.io, as the <a href="/privacy">site's privacy page</a> describes.</li>
      <li><strong>GitHub</strong>, when you open an issue in Kiln's repository yourself.</li>
      <li><strong>Anthropic</strong> and <strong>Wallu</strong>, as described under <a href="#ai">AI assistants</a> above.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="choices">Your choices</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Delete your own messages in Discord at any time. A post the launcher made for you is deleted from the launcher (Community, the post's menu, "Delete my post"), or by the Kiln team on request.</li>
      <li>Ask us to delete the support files and notes we keep about you. Write to <a href="mailto:admin@frostdev.io">admin@frostdev.io</a> or message the Kiln team in the server.</li>
      <li>If you don't want an AI assistant to read something, don't post it in the server. Send it to <a href="mailto:admin@frostdev.io">admin@frostdev.io</a> instead and say so.</li>
      <li>Sign out in the launcher, or use "Sign out and forget me", which also deletes what frostdev.io keeps. Turn "Show Kiln on my Discord profile" off there, and stop testing there.</li>
      <li>Remove the Kiln app's access in Discord: User Settings, then Authorized Apps. This does not sign the launcher out, so sign out there too.</li>
      <li>Leave the Kiln Discord server. The launcher and Kiln keep working without Discord.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="age">Age</h2>
    <p>Discord sets a minimum age for its users. The Kiln app and the launcher's Discord features are for people who may use Discord under Discord's own terms.</p>

    <h2 id="changes">Changes and questions</h2>
    <p>Changes to this page are dated here. When a change means we handle more data than before, we also announce it in the Kiln Discord server. Questions and requests go to <a href="mailto:admin@frostdev.io">admin@frostdev.io</a>.</p>
    <p><a href="/kiln/terms">Terms for Kiln on Discord</a> · <a href="/kiln/discord">Kiln on Discord</a></p>
